   "html": "<section class=\"hero\"><p class=\"desk-edition\">Daily refresh 2026-10-25 (SHORT Sunday)</p><div class=\"hero-top\"><span class=\"hero-kicker\">Daily Summary</span><span class=\"badge cautious hero-regime\">Cautious</span></div><p class=\"headline\">Cautious — the $80k flush got bought, but the longs came right back.</p><ul class=\"hero-story\"><li class=\"watch\"><span class=\"st-dot\">🟡</span><span class=\"st-text\"><span class=\"st-lead\">Sunday lens</span>Saturday's break under $80k (low ~$79.1k, lowest since Sep 18) cleared about $840M of positions, mostly longs, and buyers pushed BTC back to ~$80.8k.</span></li><li class=\"watch\"><span class=\"st-dot\">🟡</span><span class=\"st-text\"><span class=\"st-lead\">Watch</span>on-chain cycle Bearish; shorts pressing.</span></li></ul><div class=\"hero-metrics\"><div class=\"hm sig-neutral\"><div class=\"lbl\">BTC</div><div class=\"val\">$80,760</div><div class=\"chg\">7d -1.5% · 30d -3.9%</div><span class=\"sig neutral\">⚪ Range-bound</span></div><div class=\"hm sig-neutral\"><div class=\"lbl\">ETH</div><div class=\"val\">$2,362</div><div class=\"chg\">7d -1.9% · 30d -12.2%</div><span class=\"sig neutral\">⚪ In line with BTC</span><div class=\"mean\">ETH in line with BTC this week.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-neg\"><div class=\"lbl\">Fed liquidity</div><div class=\"val word\">↓ Deteriorating</div><div class=\"chg\">4w flat</div><span class=\"sig neg\">🔴 Draining liquidity</span><div class=\"mean\">Net Fed liquidity fell in the weekly print.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-neg\"><div class=\"lbl\">Treasury cash</div><div class=\"val word\">↑ Rebuilding</div><div class=\"chg\">7d rebuilding · 4w rebuilding</div><span class=\"sig neg\">🔴 Removes liquidity</span></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos\"><div class=\"lbl\">BTC ETF flows</div><div class=\"val pos\">+$301M</div><div class=\"chg\">week 19–23 Oct</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Inflows</span><div class=\"mean\">Institutions bought on 3/5 days.</div></div><